# Map commit author identities to GitHub-verified addresses.
#
# The repo's commits were authored under "Charon <charon@extol.work>",
# which is not a GitHub-verified email on any account. This mailmap
# tells `git shortlog`, `git blame`, and GitHub's Contributors graph
